# The inputs of the mainline RC-10b install images of uc-pxx-installer (KIND=release): RC-10a (mainline-rc10a-install.inputs,
# INSTALLER_COMMIT 8ff1027) with the RC-10b changes (owner 2026-11-16): the Cancel-mid-send fix of uc-pxx-inst (no gadget
# change while a file comes over the cable), and step2set = the RC-10b base 0.2.0-rc10b-base of uc-pxx-linux
# r23-base-rc10b a93819a (manifest 04f4f064: uc-pxx-provision 6dfc8268 with the health gate, uc-pxx-step2 86d305ec with
# the clone without the content compares, finish.json 66dfb112 naming uc-pxx-step2-finish 446a35be).
# image/build.sh --install --board both --inputs THIS-FILE, from INSTALLER_COMMIT. Every other value is RC-10a's: the A/B
# tool uc-pxx-bootctl-inst r3 639b6514, the step-1 USB service uc-pxx-xfer 62421c48 (unchanged bytes), the kernel and the
# tools. The build stops if a value differs. New tokens and time (used by no other inputs file). The images are for no
# unit until the release review names their sha256 and the safety rules name the image and the unit.
